config BR2_PACKAGE_K230_AMP_CAMERA_POOL
	bool "AMP reserved-memory shared DMA-BUF pool"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Allocate variable-size pinned buffers from a configurable no-map
	  AMP reserved-memory region and export them as DMA-BUF file
	  descriptors plus opaque remote-visible tokens. The K230 build uses
	  its AMP camera carveout as the first platform backend.
